# Mission 5: rehearsal-run output (database dumps, backup archives,
# manifests generated by running the rehearsal against staging) - never
# committed, even when the data inside is 100% synthetic. Only the
# scripts/docs describing the procedure are tracked; the evidence a given
# run produces stays local. See docs/platform/PRODUCTION_REHEARSAL_PLAN.md.
docs/platform/rehearsal-artifacts/

# Mission 13: the operator-side Paddle Sandbox evidence collector's own
# local credential file (`.env` above already covers this by pattern, but
# stated explicitly here since it's Paddle API key material) and its
# captured-evidence output - real Sandbox subscription/adjustment IDs and
# payloads, never secrets, but not something to commit either.
scripts/paddle-sandbox-evidence/.env
scripts/paddle-sandbox-evidence/evidence/
scripts/paddle-sandbox-evidence/__pycache__/
scripts/paddle-sandbox-evidence/.pytest_cache/
